#AREA Piscyra~
#AUTHORS Grimace~





#HELPS
-1 Piscyra~
{110}The rumours of the existance of a floating city somewhere to the
north of the eastern continent of the realms have been around for years,
though, as is the nature with folklore, the facts have become blurred with
time and the telling.  The most reliable report comes from an old hermit
who makes his home on the beach north of Olympus in a small shack
constructed of dessicated whale bone and driftwood.  In a short interview
we had over a sandpit-fried squid, he spoke to me in moments of lucidity
punctuated by manic laughter.  He told a tale of a prosperous slave trade
presided over by a foul pirate, whose ship holds are full of mushroom
women and children.  He also spoke of a band of refugees from an island
paradise who were driven to the sea by a huge turquoise wave which sunk
their island and the reefs around it.  Some say it was fate, some say it
was Lord Neptune, but there is no doubt that this island sunk into an
abyss, taking most of its population with it.  The few survivors of this
catastrophe used their advanced technological knowledge to construct a
walled city in the middle of the sea, where their descendents still live
today.  Shortly after the interview, the hermit stripped off his crusty
leather loincloth and ran away, screaming and laughing, down the beach.

                                        -Grimace{300} 6/97
                                        (Last update: 2/22/98)~
0 $~




#RANGES 25 65 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NOTELEPORT
#MOBILES
#28700
old hermit~
An old hermit~
An old man flashes a crooked smile while peering at you through one eye.~
The old hermit has a long straggly beard which enables him to run around
buck naked on the beach with minimal embarrassment.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
0
0 S
95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 4d4+18000 14d4+200
2 780605
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 10~
say When I was just a wee lad, I travelled the realm.  
say I've been across the sea, I've seen
say amazing places and far-away lands, I've even seen 
say a walled CITY afloat in the middle of the sea.  Oh to 
say be young again.  
sigh 
~
>speech_prog city~
say Ahhh, so you seek the floating city of Piscyra?
grin $n
say Perhaps this will help:  Sail north across the sea (swnne14n
say from here), and you shall find Piscyra on the eastern horizon.  
say Good luck, traveller.
mpforce $n bow
~
