piscyrean gate guard~
The Piscyrean gate guard~
The Piscyrean gate guard blocks entrance to the city.~
The Piscyrean gate guard wears glowing turquoise armor all over her body.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_INFRARED
1000 S
75 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 1d1+10155 1d1+419
247886 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if quest (0,4,$n) == 0
  mpechoat $n The gate guard says, 'I knew you'd come.  You're here to help?'
else
  if quest (0,4,$n) == 1
    mpechoat $n The gate guard says, 'How goes the quest?'
  else
    if quest (0,4,$n) == 2
      mpechoat $n The gate guard says, 'How goes the quest?'
    else
      if quest (0,4,$n) == 3
        smile $n
        unlock gate
        open gate
        say All hail $N!  Pax Piscyra.
        mpechoat $n The gate guard bows his head as you pass.
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest (0,4,$n) == 0
  mpechoat $n The gate guard smiles and says, 'Excellent.  Bring me the head of
  mpechoat $n the vile pirate who has been tirelessly assaulting our city, and you
  mpechoat $n shall be rewarded.'
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 1
endif
~
>speech_prog no~
if quest (0,4,$n) == 0
  mpechoat $n The gate guard frowns and says, 'Then be gone.  You're worthless to me.'
endif
~
>speech_prog good~
if quest (0,4,$n) == 1
  mpechoat $n The gate guard says, 'I'm glad to hear it.  Bring me that head.'
else
  if quest (0,4,$n) == 2
    mpechoat $n The gate guard says, 'I'm glad to hear it.  Bring me that head.'
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog bad~
if quest (0,4,$n) == 1
  mpechoat $n The gate guard says, 'This isn't a quest for the faint of heart.'
  sigh 
else
  if quest (0,4,$n) == 2
    mpechoat $n The gate guard says, 'This isn't a quest for the faint of heart.'
    sigh 
  endif
endif
~
>give_prog I28738~
mpmset $n quest 0 4 3
say Ahhhh, yes.... the bastard finally met his bloody end.
mpecho The gate guard calls to a small boy who grabs the head and then disappears.
say We shall stick that foul creature's head on a spike and display it for all
say who might consider threatening our way of life again.
mpoload 28739
give I28739 $n
say Thank you, $N.
bow $n
unlock gate
open gate
mpjunk all
~
