mpquiet off
mpecho You have been bestowed with a fabulous prize.  Happy hunting!
mptransfer $n 28793
mpgoto 28793
mpmset $n quest 0 4 3
mpforce $n look
mpechoat $n The gate guard smiles when he sees what you have in your possession.
