#ROOMS
#28700
On the Beach~
You are standing on a wind-swept beach.  Some dessicated 
seaweed has putrified in the hot sun, marking the advance 
of the tides up the steep, sandy slope.  The bleached bones 
of an old whale carcass jut from the sand, a monument to 
the rhythm of life at the boundary of sea and land.  There 
is a sign here.~
287 0 SECT_DESERT
DDIR_NORTH
