#28792
In the Captain's Cabin~
This end of the room is illuminated by a single brass porthole.  The
captain's personal bunk looks hard but comfortable, and the exotic leather
chair is one of the few luxuries afforded any crew member, including the
captain, in such extreme circumstances.~
