#28793
The Gate~
A large heavy portcullis has been constructed to bridge a gap in the huge
iron walls on either side.  High above, a makeshift winch is tied with
braided hemp to two large rings on top of the gate.  The gate extends deep
into the murky water below, and you see no immediate way to enter the city
other than by permission of the gateguard who stands before you.~
