#28845
Under the Protective Overhang~
The enormous wall which protects the city also provides protection to the
homes carved into it. Seagrass pallets mark the sleeping area, and a small
brass kettle hangs from a spit near the edge of the overhang.  A few sacks
spill grain at your feet, and you get the sense that despite their meagre
existence, these people are getting by just fine.~
