#28897
At the Top of the Abyss~
Your ears pop as you head down into the cold, murky depths.  Only darkness
greets you below, and you can't help but wonder how far down you'll have to
dive before you hit bottom...

You spot a brightly colored fish sporting a unique collection of scales
which form a message.~
