#28900
A Sheltered Dock~
You stand upon a rickety dock made, evidently, from whatever wood could be
scavenged from the surrounding realms.  The floor of the home above your
head acts as a roof, giving some protection from the elements. You notice
a peddlar seated crosslegged next to a small pen. The docks lead off to the
east and west, and a braided kelp ladder twists through a small hole in the
ceiling above.~
